        id: 'q18',
        difficulty: 'easy',
        wh: 'HOW',
        pointer: null,
        q: 'How do you brush and groom a horse?',
        a: 'You use special brushes to remove dirt and loose hair from the horse\'s coat, a comb for the mane and tail, and a pick to clean mud from the hooves. Grooming is done every day — it keeps the horse clean and healthy and is also a bonding time between horse and rider.',
