        wh: 'WHAT',
        pointer: null,
        q: 'What does research tell us about the benefits of using the library for human wellbeing?',
        a: 'Research consistently shows that using the library provides significant benefits — physical, mental, social, and educational — that contribute to individual and community wellbeing across all age groups.',
