        wh: 'HOW',
        pointer: null,
        q: 'How have advances in research changed our understanding of the best approaches to libraries and reading?',
        a: 'Research has transformed libraries and reading by providing evidence about what works and what doesn\'t, replacing traditional practices with evidence-based approaches that better serve the people involved.',
