        difficulty: 'ultimate',
        wh: 'ARE',
        pointer: null,
        q: 'Are current systems of libraries and reading adequately preparing individuals for the challenges of the 21st century?',
        a: 'This is one of the most important questions facing societies today. Rapid changes in technology, climate, work patterns, and social structures mean that the systems designed in previous centuries may be increasingly misaligned with what people actually need. Meaningful reform requires honest assessment of what current approaches achieve and what they fail to provide.',
